<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Macos on knowledge base</title><link>https://kbs.yinagi.in/tags/macos/</link><description>Recent content in Macos on knowledge base</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><managingEditor>inbox@yinagi.in (murarisumit)</managingEditor><webMaster>inbox@yinagi.in (murarisumit)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Sun, 23 Jun 2024 11:14:03 +0530</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://kbs.yinagi.in/tags/macos/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>How to Run Unverified Binary on MacOS</title><link>https://kbs.yinagi.in/en/33cd415418ce142d633dd2ed852abdc4/</link><pubDate>Sun, 23 Jun 2024 11:14:03 +0530</pubDate><author>inbox@yinagi.in (murarisumit)</author><guid>https://kbs.yinagi.in/en/33cd415418ce142d633dd2ed852abdc4/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;If you are trying to run an unsigned binary on MacOS, you can do it by following these steps:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open Terminal.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run the following command:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;xattr -d com.apple.quarantine /path/to/your/binary
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Replace &lt;code&gt;/path/to/your/binary&lt;/code&gt; with the path to your binary file.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Example: &lt;code&gt;xattr -d com.apple.quarantine /Applications/minikube-gui.app&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Macos App Switcher</title><link>https://kbs.yinagi.in/en/39e6a85f2560b36262dd276126589bae/</link><pubDate>Thu, 04 Aug 2022 15:22:02 +0530</pubDate><author>inbox@yinagi.in (murarisumit)</author><guid>https://kbs.yinagi.in/en/39e6a85f2560b36262dd276126589bae/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;This is to show macos app switcher in all the monitors connected.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reset to default state:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;defaults delete com.apple.dock; killall Dock
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;then&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;2
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;defaults write com.apple.Dock appswitcher-all-displays -bool &lt;span class="nb"&gt;true&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;killall Dock
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;</description></item><item><title>Rss Reader</title><link>https://kbs.yinagi.in/en/ba2c65ac5f71fbbb97dc75d07ed25f89/</link><pubDate>Sun, 03 Jul 2022 00:47:21 +0530</pubDate><author>inbox@yinagi.in (murarisumit)</author><guid>https://kbs.yinagi.in/en/ba2c65ac5f71fbbb97dc75d07ed25f89/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Personally I prefer &lt;a href="https://www.reederapp.com"&gt;reederapp&lt;/a&gt;. It has built-in RSS feeds, beautiful interface and sync across devices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;But if someone is looking for Open Sourcs RSS Reader that works on iOS ecosystem, then &lt;a href="https://netnewswire.com"&gt;netnewswire&lt;/a&gt; is good option without putting lot of money before locking into RSS.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Linuxify</title><link>https://kbs.yinagi.in/en/96b18098f374caabc54fa7d41fdfcecc/</link><pubDate>Mon, 09 May 2022 01:58:48 +0530</pubDate><author>inbox@yinagi.in (murarisumit)</author><guid>https://kbs.yinagi.in/en/96b18098f374caabc54fa7d41fdfcecc/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Smart scripts to setup the system and eliminating overhead of maintaining scripts.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Iterm Auto Theme Switch</title><link>https://kbs.yinagi.in/bookmarks/iterm-auto-theme-switch/</link><pubDate>Mon, 26 Jul 2021 22:35:37 +0530</pubDate><author>inbox@yinagi.in (murarisumit)</author><guid>https://kbs.yinagi.in/bookmarks/iterm-auto-theme-switch/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;It should be native feature in iterm, so hoping same someday. Till then here you are.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>